# Monsters we want more fights with, chained on the spot or banked as a wanderer.
# A loc: here is where the copy itself has to be fought, not just where we may copy it.
# A sameday:1 here means every fight it owes us has to land today, or the copies already spent are wasted.
# A reserve:1 here claims the copies it still needs, leaving other monsters only the surplus.
# The fights here are also limited by 'desiredEncounters', unless the desired encounters did not register it
### Level 8 - ore for the trapper
Mountain Man	quest:questL08Trapper<2	prop_boolean:auto_mountainManWantCopy
### The Cyrpt
giant swarm of ghuol whelps	prop:cyrptCrannyEvilness>17
big swarm of ghuol whelps	prop:cyrptCrannyEvilness>17
swarm of ghuol whelps	prop:cyrptCrannyEvilness>17
modern zmobie	prop:cyrptAlcoveEvilness>19	js:initiativeModifier()<800
### Level 12 - gunpowder for the lighthouse
lobsterfrogman	item:barrel of gunpowder<4	prop:sidequestLighthouseCompleted=none	quest:questL12War=1	reserve:1
### Level 11 - Hidden City pygmies
pygmy witch accountant	loc:The Hidden Office Building	item:McClusky file (complete)<1	item:McClusky file (page 5)<1	!prop:questL11Business=finished
pygmy witch accountant	loc:The Hidden Apartment Building	item:McClusky file (complete)<1	item:McClusky file (page 5)<1	!prop:questL11Business=finished	js:get("hiddenApartmentProgress") >= 7 || (haveEffect($effect`Thrice-Cursed`) || -1) >= turnsUntilForcedNoncombat($location`The Hidden Apartment Building`)
pygmy shaman	loc:The Hidden Apartment Building	!effect:Thrice-Cursed	!effect:Twice-Cursed	prop:hiddenApartmentProgress<7
Pygmy Bowler	js:get("hiddenBowlingAlleyProgress") + itemAmount($item`bowling ball`) < 6
pygmy witch surgeon	js:!have($item`head mirror`) && get("hiddenHospitalProgress") < 7
### Level 11 - Palindome book and photograph
# only the dudes we fight inside the Palindome count towards either drop
# wait for the other three photographs, before that we'll let the zone hand us Bobs on its own
Racecar Bob	loc:Inside the Palindome	quest:questL11Palindome<=0	js:$items`photograph of a red nugget, photograph of an ostrich egg, photograph of God`.every(it => have(it))
Bob Racecar	loc:Inside the Palindome	quest:questL11Palindome<=0	js:$items`photograph of a red nugget, photograph of an ostrich egg, photograph of God`.every(it => have(it))
### Level 13 - stars and lines for the star key
Camel's Toe	item:star<7	item:line<6	js:!get("nsTowerDoorKeysUsed").includes("star key") && !have($item`Richard's star key`)
Skinflute	item:star<7	item:line<6	js:!get("nsTowerDoorKeysUsed").includes("star key") && !have($item`Richard's star key`)
### Level 13 - fat loot token from the 5th fantasy bandit of the day
# The kill count only ticks up once a fight ends, so it still reads 4 during the 5th (final) fight - don't chain a 6th.
fantasy bandit	js:!canAdventure($location`The Bandit Crossroads`) && parseInt(get("_frMonstersKilled").split("fantasy bandit:")[1] || "0") < 4	sameday:1	reserve:1
